From: CaptainCucumber <37813159+CaptainCucumber@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 11:17:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add bounded native rail catalog

---
 src/network/network_admin.cpp | 72 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/network/network_admin.h   |  1 +
 2 files changed, 73 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/network/network_admin.cpp b/src/network/network_admin.cpp
